      "text": "he who obeys evil spirit receives for wages eternal punishment, Mosiah 2:33. every man receives wages of him whom he obeys, Alma 3:27. whoso hearkens to devil’s voice must receive wages of devil, Alma 5:41–42. judges receive wages according to time that they labored to judge, Alma 11:1. the Lord will be swift witness against those who oppress hireling in his wages, 3 Ne. 24:5 (Mal. 3:5). according to works shall wages be, Morm. 8:19.",
